module parallel.diagnostics

tool Diagnose
    description "Return a diagnosis for the supplied incident."
    takes request as Text
    gives Text

agent Specialist
    takes request as Text
    gives Text
    responsibility "Diagnose the supplied incident using the authorized diagnostic capability."
    uses Diagnose
    callable_by strategy Run

strategy Run
    takes incidents as List of Text
    gives List of Text
    uses Specialist
    do
        parallel Specialist
            each incident in incidents
            with request as incident
            max_concurrency 4
            max_items 32
            into diagnoses
        give diagnoses
